  runnerWalkStateName: Gangsters_2 Walk
  runnerWalkParameterName: Walk
  runnerStartPoint: {fileID: 325495789}
  runnerEndPoint: {fileID: 80211935}
  runnerYOffset: 0
  quoteText: {fileID: 1645992554}
  quotes:
  - '"Jazz is playing. Lead is flying. No one gets away alive."'
  - '"If you haven''t been buried, you haven''t lost yet. You''re just rebooting."'
  - '"He came as a puppy. He left as a king. But the crown weighs heavy when it''s
    covered in blood."'
  - '"Keep your enemies close. And crush the rats immediately."'
  - '"Blood is not water. Blood is the glue that holds a family together. Without
    it, you''re just meat."'
  - '"New Eastern doesn''t forgive the weak. Every alley here remembers your name...
    or your blood."'
  - '"Betrayal doesn''t have a smell. It comes with a smile and coffee."'
  - '"Don''t look back. There''s only corpses."'
